1
00:00:00,540 --> 00:00:04,950
(Penny:)Oh, unbelievable!

2
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:09,620
(Penny:)Know how he did it yet?

3
00:00:14,590 --> 00:00:16,160
(Leonard:)Um...

4
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:19,360
(Penny:)Aw, he has the same look
my little nephew gets

5
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:22,160
(Penny:)when he can't figure out
how I got his nose.

6
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:27,770
(Howard:)You know, I have some remedial
magic tricks

7
00:00:27,770 --> 00:00:29,540
(Howard:)that might be more your speed.

8
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:30,970
(Howard:)Like, ooh, look!

9
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:34,310
(Howard:)The pencil's rubber!

10
00:00:35,810 --> 00:00:38,780
(Penny:)Hey, I think I know how you did
the card trick.

11
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:42,150
(Sheldon:)Oh, please, if I don't know,
you don't know.

12
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:43,800
(Sheldon:)That's axiomatic.

13
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,690
(Penny:)Come here.

14
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:48,520
(Howard:)You're right.

15
00:00:50,290 --> 00:00:51,960
(Penny:)Not too bad for someone

16
00:00:51,960 --> 00:01:01,020
(Penny:)who doesn't know
what "axiomatic" means.

